<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Inertia</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Boston Manor</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Datura</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">2htXlAddhNeQHs4tYj4MGv</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.020" end="00:24.020">Just trying to make enough so you don’t have to feed me. You’re the only one I trust &amp; I know that you believe me. Because you go where I go.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.580" end="00:43.580">Inertia. We both made our mark. Inertia. I’ve been gone so long.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.790" end="01:07.890">But you are still my home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.890" end="01:15.890">Sometimes I watch you sleep. A ripple in the calmness &amp; all we need is these four walls. So we can both wait out the darkness.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.790" end="01:28.290">Because you go where I go.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.420" end="01:35.420">Inertia. We both made our mark. Inertia.I’ve been gone so long.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:54.810" end="01:58.530">But you are still my home. Because you go where I go</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:58.530" end="02:06.530">Inertia. I’ve been gone so long. But you are still my home</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:22.170" end="02:30.170">Let the pink light up your eyes. The warm waves touch your skin. It’s a new world outside. Let the big wide world in.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:37.530" end="02:45.530">Inertia. You are still my home.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:06.060" end="03:13.710">Inertia. You are still my home.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="03:13.710" end="03:21.710">Inertia. I’ve been gone so long.</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="05:07.140" end="05:11.140">Inertia. But you are still my home.</p></div></body></tt>